SUMMARY:Union Samples: Batiste
DESCRIPTION:Batiste × Forget Me Not Coffee — Union Station Pop-Up Monday\, July 20 – Friday\, July 24 \nBatiste is popping up in Union Station’s Bay Promenade in partnership with Toronto’s local Forget Me Not Coffee. From 10:00 AM – 2:00 PM daily\, commuters and visitors can enjoy a complimentary curated drink\, thoughtfully paired with one of Batiste’s everyday essential Dry Shampoos (while supplies last). \nCan’t stop by midday? Batiste Brand Ambassadors will be on-site 8:00 AM – 7:00 PM distributing complimentary Batiste Dry Shampoo samples (while quantities last) — your chance to refresh on the go and find your everyday essential. \n 
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/union-samples-batiste/2026-07-24/
LOCATION:Bay Union Samples Kiosk\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, M5R 1V9\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Samples
