SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: Jamie Lee
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio! Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. \nUnion Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day.
