SUMMARY:Rudy Ray Show: Moskitto Bar
DESCRIPTION:Step into the rich\, evolving world of jazz with the Rudy Ray Jazz Show at Union Summer. This captivating series explores jazz across the ages\, weaving together timeless traditions and global influences. Each week an eclectic mix of musicians brings boundary-pushing sounds—it’s an immersive musical journey that celebrates the artistry\, history\, and soul of jazz. \nMoskitto Bar delivers a global sounds performance reflecting Toronto’s multicultural musical identity\, blending diverse influences into a cohesive live experience rooted in rhythm\, texture\, and cross-cultural expression. The set highlights the fluidity of contemporary jazz and global fusion\, aligning with the Rudy Ray series’ focus on boundary-pushing music. \nThis program is in partnership with Rudy Ray.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/rudy-ray-show-moskitto-bar/
