SUMMARY:TD Music Tuesdays: Music by House of Bala - DJ SATSB
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with our premier sponsor TD\, Union Summer presents a diverse and dynamic lineup of artists in collaboration with TD-supported festivals. July and August programming features performers from TD-supported festivals\, showcasing a wide range of sounds and cultural influences. \nIn partnership with Desifest\, this performance highlights South Asian music and celebration through rhythm\, dance\, and community connection.
