SUMMARY:Tuesday Tastemaker Series: Mamma Mia! Sing-Along
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday Tastemaker Series at Union Summer brings together music lovers\, industry insiders\, and emerging talent for an elevated midweek experience. In partnership with Polaris Music Prize\, Departure Festival\, and Mirvish Productions\, the patio transforms into a vibrant showcase designed for discovery and connection where tastemakers gather to mix\, mingle\, and experience incredible live music. \nThis special edition features a Sing-Along inspired by Mamma Mia!\, presented in partnership with Mirvish Productions\, delivering a high-energy\, interactive musical theatre experience built around audience participation and classic pop hits.
