SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: OTR
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio! Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. \nUnion Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nDJ OTR (Dereshean Jarrett) is a Toronto-based DJ\, audio engineer\, and producer known for his versatile sound and strong technical background. Starting his career through DJing and later expanding into production and engineering\, he trained at Trebas Institute and further developed his craft through The Remix Project’s Recording Arts program. \nHe has worked with a wide range of artists and brands\, including Jhené Aiko\, DVSN\, COLORS Studios\, Mercedes-Benz Canada\, and Reebok Canada\, building a reputation for polished\, genre-spanning musical work across both live and studio environments.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/best-of-union-beats-dj-otr/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
