DESCRIPTION:Thursdays just became the new Fridays. Head to Union Summer for a high-energy night featuring live DJs and bands. \nUnion Summer’s TGIT series transforms the patio into a vibrant evening destination\, kicking off the weekend early with high-energy performances\, great music\, and a lively crowd. Come for the vibes\, stay for everything that makes Thursday the best night of the week. \nDJ Spexx takes over the TGIT stage with a DJ set built for an upbeat\, open-air patio experience.
