SUMMARY:Soul Sessions: Bubblegum Bikini
DESCRIPTION:Ease into the weekend with Soul Sessions every Friday night at Union Summer. \nFrom smooth R&B and classic Motown to timeless hits across the decades\, our live performers reimagine the songs you love with fresh energy and irresistible groove. It’s a feel-good night of music\, movement\, and nostalgia—guaranteed to get you dancing under the open sky. \nBubblegum Bikini is a Toronto-based live band known for high-energy performances that blend funk\, soul\, rock\, and pop into dancefloor-focused sets. Built around a five-piece lineup of seasoned musicians\, the group delivers a vibrant\, party-driven live experience designed to keep audiences moving. \nWith regular residencies across Toronto venues\, Bubblegum Bikini has developed a strong local following for their upbeat sound and crowd-centered performances.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/soul-sessions-bubblegum-bikini/
