DESCRIPTION:Power up your weekend with Saturday Vibes at Union Summer. \nEase into your best summer mood with curated DJ sets spinning feel-good tracks\, setting the perfect tone for sun-soaked hangs. It’s all about great music\, easy energy\, and those spontaneous moments that spark connection and get your day going. \nDJ Lewy V brings an energetic set designed to keep the Saturday afternoon moving with smooth transitions\, crowd-pleasing selections\, and a vibrant summer atmosphere.
