SUMMARY:Brunch & Brass: Red Hot Ramble
DESCRIPTION:Soak up the sunshine as lively brass ensembles fill the patio with rich\, feel-good sounds—perfectly paired with a relaxed midday bite. It’s a laid-back\, joyful way to gather\, unwind\, and let the music carry you through your Sunday. \nRed Hot Ramble delivers a high-energy blend of traditional jazz\, blues\, funk\, and second-line rhythms inspired by the spirit of New Orleans\, infused with a distinctly Canadian flavour. Their performances move fluidly between celebration and storytelling\, combining musicality with an unmistakable sense of groove. \nBuilt around music about people—their ups\, downs\, loves\, and struggles—the group creates an engaging live experience designed for both listening and dancing. Their shows are known for infectious energy
