SUMMARY:Monday Blues: Samantha Martin & Delta Sugar
DESCRIPTION:Ease into your week with Monday Blues at Union Summer\, featuring two shows of blues music showcasing a range of artists. \nSamantha Martin & Delta Sugar are one of Canada’s most electrifying blues-soul bands\, blending gospel\, roots\, and retro-soul with powerhouse vocals and high-energy live performance. Led by JUNO-nominated artist Samantha Martin\, the group is known for its commanding stage presence and genre-crossing sound. \nOften described as “the Daptone of Canada\,” the band has earned multiple JUNO and Maple Blues Award nominations and international recognition for their dynamic performances and rich\, soulful arrangements. Their upcoming live album A Beautiful Buzz captures the raw energy that defines their sound and reputation as a standout festival act. \nThe Toronto Blues Society (TBS) is a non-profit organization dedicated to promoting and preserving the legacy of blues music. As it celebrates over 40 years of supporting the genre\, it continues to honour its roots while fostering future generations of artists. \nThis program is in partnership with the Toronto Blues Society (TBS).
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/monday-blues-samantha-martin-delta-sugar/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
