SUMMARY:Global Music Nights: Lemon Bucket Orkestra
DESCRIPTION:Let’s go global! Union Summer’s Global Music Nights bring the world to the waterfront with a vibrant roster of local\, national\, and international artists. \nExperience an unforgettable mix of sounds\, rhythms\, and traditions as the patio transforms into a celebration of global talent\, connection\, and discovery. \nLemon Bucket Orkestra joins Union Summer for an energetic evening performance\, bringing their signature blend of global influences and high-energy live music to the waterfront. \nThis program is in partnership with SummerWorks.
